    {
      "id": "7d78df3f-98d7-4d53-af20-ad6dd1ca1d3c",
      "name": "Sticky Note",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "position": [
        208,
        -320
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "color": 5,
        "width": 528,
        "height": 320,
        "content": "WooCommerce AI Sales Agent Overview\n\nThis workflow turns n8n into an AI powered sales assistant for WooCommerce.\nIt can:\n1. Detect customer intent (FAQ, product search, payment, lead capture).\n2. Search products directly in WooCommerce and show stock details.\n3. Answer FAQs using RAG with Qdrant and Google Drive documents.\n4. Generate Stripe payment links for checkout.\n5. Capture leads into CRM.\n6. Escalate unclear cases to human agents via Telegram.\n\nResult: A 24/7 automated sales agent that helps customers from discovery to payment to lead capture."
      },
      "typeVersion": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "6462a494-08bc-43ef-ac60-405f1a5861bb",
      "name": "Sticky Note1",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "position": [
        -496,
        -720
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "color": 3,
        "width": 528,
        "height": 256,
        "content": "Setup and Customization Notes\n\nBefore using this workflow:\n1. Connect credentials: WooCommerce API, Stripe, CRM, Google Drive, OpenAI or Gemini, Qdrant, Telegram.\n2. Adjust language or localization if needed.\n3. Update Google Drive folder ID where your sales docs are stored.\n4. Use Qdrant Wipe if you want to re-index fresh documents.\n5. Customize agents response style in the Sales AI Agent system prompt."
      },
      "typeVersion": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "e2641b81-60fb-48c2-b763-a3b55864fa44",
      "name": "Sticky Note2",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "position": [
        208,
        -1056
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "color": 5,
        "width": 528,
        "height": 352,
        "content": "Knowledge Base Update Flow\n\nPurpose: Keeps the AI FAQ knowledge accurate and up to date.\n\nHow it works:\n1. Trigger (Manual Execute) -> Run when you want to refresh the knowledge base.\n2. Qdrant Wipe -> Clears all old vectors.\n3. Google Drive List and Download -> Loads all sales and policy documents from the configured folder.\n4. Splitter and Embeddings -> Splits text into chunks and creates embeddings.\n5. Qdrant Insert -> Stores embeddings in vector DB for retrieval.\n\nUse this flow whenever sales policies, product docs, or FAQs are updated."
      },
      "typeVersion": 1
    }
